                              "disease_code":  "HYPERTENSIVE_URGENCY",
                              "distinguishing_feature":  "Overactive bladder is a urological syndrome with urinary urgency/frequency driven by detrusor overactivity; hypertensive urgency is a cardiovascular emergency driven by severely elevated blood pressure — the word \u0027urgency\u0027 is unrelated."
