                              "disease_code":  "INTERSTITIAL_CYSTITIS_CHRONIC_WITHOUT_HEMATURIA",
                              "distinguishing_feature":  "Overactive bladder has urgency with frequency but no bladder pain; interstitial cystitis has chronic bladder/pelvic pain as the dominant symptom with urgency secondary to pain rather than detrusor overactivity."
